Initialize the key event fields gpui-pre's patches add

gpui-pre's patch 001 adds optional physical key and native layout metadata
(original key text, raw modifiers, lock states) to KeyDownEvent and
KeyUpEvent. GPUI Kit builds those events itself in its controls and tests,
so each constructor here sets the new fields to their empty defaults, as a
synthetic event does; shortcut dispatch is unchanged.

Remove with gpui-pre's patch 001, when GPUI exposes physical keys and layout
metadata on key events.

